  "weekLabel": "Week of Oct 26–30, 2026",
  "headline": "OPay is the week's only scheduled IPO as the Anthropic filing watch continues",
  "summary": "Renaissance Capital and IPOScoop show one sizable IPO for the week of Oct 26: Nigeria-focused fintech OPay (NYSE: OPAY), offering 16M ADSs at $19–$21 to raise ~$320M at a ~$4.2B market cap, with cornerstone investors indicating interest in ~$270M (84% of the deal). IPOScoop also lists SPAC SPACCircle Acquisition (~$100M, Tue Oct 27; unconfirmed). Anthropic still had no public S-1 as of Oct 24; IFR reported a filing for Mon, Oct 26 and a roadshow from Nov 9, and Renaissance says that if the S-1 doesn't land by Monday a December debut becomes increasingly likely. Last week Lycia Therapeutics (LYCA) upsized, priced at the top ($18) and jumped 66.7% on its Oct 23 debut, the best recent debut; Iambic (IAM) has slipped to -10.9% from its $16 IPO price after a strong start. Filings: biotechs Windward Bio and Rezera (~$100M each), Sensing4D AI and iStep Learning. Kepuni withdrew and BW Industrial postponed; Renaissance says the AI sell-off has sidelined big AI deals like SB Energy, Nscale and DayOne. Renaissance's IPO Index was up 6.0% YTD vs the S&P 500's 13.0% as of Oct 22.",
  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "OPay (OPAY, NYSE) plans to price ~$320M at $19–$21 this week, the only sizable IPO on the calendar",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Anthropic's public S-1 is reported for Mon, Oct 26 (IFR); Renaissance says a miss pushes the debut toward December",
      "unconfirmed": true,
      "note": "Reported, not confirmed"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lycia Therapeutics (LYCA) +66.7% on its Oct 23 debut after an upsized, top-of-range $318M IPO",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Iambic (IAM) has flipped to -10.9% from its IPO price; Amaero (AMRO) is +37.4%",
      "unconfirmed": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Kepuni withdrew its $15M IPO; BW Industrial postponed; big AI deals (SB Energy, Nscale, DayOne) sidelined by the AI sell-off",
      "unconfirmed": false
    }
  ],
